    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45853" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Subertāni</span></b> , ōrum,
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a people of Etruria</i>, <i>the inhabitants of
				Subertum</i>, <i>the modern Sovretto in
			Tuscany</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5, 8, § 52</span></i>.
			—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Subertānus</span></b> , a, um, adj.,
				<i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the
				Subertani</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">forum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					26, 23, 5</span></i>
			.</div>
